          "details": "<p>Fly up in the sky and Deploy a wave of bombardment that slowly falls to the ground. Deal <strong>10 fire damage</strong> to all enemies and inflicts <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"> <strong>Burn</strong> &nbsp;at the start of next round.</p>",
