          "details": "<p><strong>【Cost:50MP】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Grants target ally <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/13_BLM/fire_III.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"> <strong>50 Fire Shield </strong><em>(Cannot be cast on self)</em></p>",
